{"id":"6e90892ab288d53f","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-max-function.md","title":"Primitive Recursive Maximum","display":"df-max-function — Primitive Recursive Maximum","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-max-function","aliases":["57-df-max-function"],"display":"df-max-function — Primitive Recursive Maximum","depends_on":["[[57-df-subtraction-function]]","[[57-df-primitive-recursive]]","[[57-df-addition-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-max-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-max-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-max-function — Primitive Recursive Maximum"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7944760e23c02c51\" href=\"?note=7944760e23c02c51\" title=\"57-df-subtraction-function\">57-df-subtraction-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6198f000bea16af4\" href=\"?note=6198f000bea16af4\" title=\"57-df-primitive-recursive\">57-df-primitive-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7419fb5f5a6ad5df\" href=\"?note=7419fb5f5a6ad5df\" title=\"57-df-addition-function\">57-df-addition-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>背景为集合论元语言，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y,z,a,b,n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(x,y,z,a,b,n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> 包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\ge1\">\\(k\\ge1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_0,\\ldots,x_{k+1}\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(x_0,\\ldots,x_{k+1}\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sub}\">\\(\\operatorname{sub}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7944760e23c02c51\" href=\"?note=7944760e23c02c51\" title=\"57-df-subtraction-function\">57-df-subtraction-function</a> 的二元截断减法，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}_2\">\\(\\mathrm{PR}_2\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6198f000bea16af4\" href=\"?note=6198f000bea16af4\" title=\"57-df-primitive-recursive\">57-df-primitive-recursive</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{add}\">\\(\\mathrm{add}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"7419fb5f5a6ad5df\" href=\"?note=7419fb5f5a6ad5df\" title=\"57-df-addition-function\">57-df-addition-function</a> 的自然数加法。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\max_{\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\max_{\\mathbb N}\\)</span> 是下式引入的二元全函数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Max}_{\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\operatorname{Max}_{\\mathbb N}\\)</span> 是集合取最大值的部分函数图；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\max(x,y)\">\\(\\max(x,y)\\)</span>、多参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\max\">\\(\\max\\)</span> 和集合写法 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\max A\">\\(\\max A\\)</span> 的接口在下式给出。点值只在各自定义域内使用；这些记号不向对象算术语言增加原始符号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\max_{\\mathbb N}:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N,\\qquad\n\\max_{\\mathbb N}(x,y)\\coloneqq \\mathrm{add}(x,\\operatorname{sub}(y,x)),\\qquad\n\\max(x,y)\\coloneqq\\max_{\\mathbb N}(x,y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\max_{\\mathbb N}:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N,\\qquad\n\\max_{\\mathbb N}(x,y)\\coloneqq \\mathrm{add}(x,\\operatorname{sub}(y,x)),\\qquad\n\\max(x,y)\\coloneqq\\max_{\\mathbb N}(x,y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\max_{\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathrm{PR}_2.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\max_{\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathrm{PR}_2.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\max(x,y)=z\\longleftrightarrow\n(y\\le x\\land z=x)\\lor(x&lt;y\\land z=y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\max(x,y)=z\\longleftrightarrow\n(y\\le x\\land z=x)\\lor(x&lt;y\\land z=y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Max}_{\\mathbb N}\\coloneqq\n\\{(A,n)\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\times\\mathbb N:\nn\\in A\\land\\forall a\\in A\\ (a\\le n)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Max}_{\\mathbb N}\\coloneqq\n\\{(A,n)\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\times\\mathbb N:\nn\\in A\\land\\forall a\\in A\\ (a\\le n)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Max}_{\\mathbb N}:\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{Max}_{\\mathbb N})=\n\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N:A\\ne\\varnothing\\land\n\\exists b\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall a\\in A\\ (a\\le b)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Max}_{\\mathbb N}:\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{Max}_{\\mathbb N})=\n\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N:A\\ne\\varnothing\\land\n\\exists b\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall a\\in A\\ (a\\le b)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\max A\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Max}_{\\mathbb N}(A)\n\\quad(A\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{Max}_{\\mathbb N})),\\qquad\n\\max\\{x,y\\}=\\max(x,y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\max A\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Max}_{\\mathbb N}(A)\n\\quad(A\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{Max}_{\\mathbb N})),\\qquad\n\\max\\{x,y\\}=\\max(x,y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\max(x_0,\\ldots,x_{k+1})\\coloneqq\n\\max_{\\mathbb N}(\\max(x_0,\\ldots,x_k),x_{k+1}),\\qquad\n\\max(x_0,\\ldots,x_k)=\\max\\{x_0,\\ldots,x_k\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\max(x_0,\\ldots,x_{k+1})\\coloneqq\n\\max_{\\mathbb N}(\\max(x_0,\\ldots,x_k),x_{k+1}),\\qquad\n\\max(x_0,\\ldots,x_k)=\\max\\{x_0,\\ldots,x_k\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地补充定义。加法与截断减法的复合给出二元 max 的原始递归性。按 y≤x 与 x&lt;y 分情形得到所列取值刻画；固定参数个数的多参数 max 由有限次复合得到。非空有界自然数集是非空有限集，因而有唯一最大元；反之最大元本身给出界，证明了集合图的精确定义域。空集及无界自然数集不取默认值。</p>\n<p>二元公式核对依据：<a href=\"https://www.andrew.cmu.edu/user/kk3n/recursionclass/chap2.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CMU《Primitive Recursion》§2.6.13</a>，印刷第 14 页／PDF 第 7 页。集合图与多参数记号是本地接口补充，不据此声称核验本书原文。此处固定自然数通常序；集合取值不自动给出任意输入集合的有效表示或可计算性，也不规定整数、实数或无限基数的 max。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-subtraction-function","status":"resolved","id":"7944760e23c02c51","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-d