se},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Max}_{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\max(x,y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\max","display":false},{"tex":"\\max A","display":false},{"tex":"\\max_{\\mathbb N}:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N,\\qquad\n\\max_{\\mathbb N}(x,y)\\coloneqq \\mathrm{add}(x,\\operatorname{sub}(y,x)),\\qquad\n\\max(x,y)\\coloneqq\\max_{\\mathbb N}(x,y).","display":true},{"tex":"\\max_{\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathrm{PR}_2.","display":true},{"tex":"\\max(x,y)=z\\longleftrightarrow\n(y\\le x\\land z=x)\\lor(x<y\\land z=y).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Max}_{\\mathbb N}\\coloneqq\n\\{(A,n)\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\times\\mathbb N:\nn\\in A\\land\\forall a\\in A\\ (a\\le n)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Max}_{\\mathbb N}:\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{Max}_{\\mathbb N})=\n\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N:A\\ne\\varnothing\\land\n\\exists b\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall a\\in A\\ (a\\le b)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\max A\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Max}_{\\mathbb N}(A)\n\\quad(A\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{Max}_{\\mathbb N})),\\qquad\n\\max\\{x,y\\}=\\max(x,y).","display":true},{"tex":"\\max(x_0,\\ldots,x_{k+1})\\coloneqq\n\\max_{\\mathbb N}(\\max(x_0,\\ldots,x_k),x_{k+1}),\\qquad\n\\max(x_0,\\ldots,x_k)=\\max\\{x_0,\\ldots,x_k\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":2851,"backlinks":[{"id":"712165bc47a6ac48","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{sub}$ 取 [[57-df-subtraction-function]]，自然数集合的 $\\max$ 取 [[57-df-max-function]]；商的正除数分支中候选集包含 $0$ 且以 $a$ 为界。"},{"id":"40d1acedbbf319e7","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\{0,1\\}$ 上的二元 $\\max$ 取 [[57-df-max-function]]；两个递归返回值均为自然数。"},{"id":"b2e96ed477b7b031","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"自然数集合的 $\\max$ 取 [[57-df-max-function]]；$u>0$ 时所示指数候选集包含 $0$ 且以 $u$ 为界。"},{"id":"6c712d26a957f90f","anchor":"ref-6","locations":